<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 17.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 17.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 17		July 16</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.131		  6.562</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  19.307		 14.789</p>
<p>Cash balance		  24.438		 21.351</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,277.127	     5,272.427</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $18 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
